{"id":506,"date":"2011-08-13T20:36:59","date_gmt":"2011-08-13T20:36:59","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=506"},"modified":"2015-04-24T23:21:12","modified_gmt":"2015-04-24T22:21:12","slug":"projet-barrette-realise","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2011\/08\/13\/projet-barrette-realise\/","title":{"rendered":"Projet barrette: r\u00e9alis\u00e9!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Les 7 inscrits ont termin\u00e9 le montage et r\u00e9glage de leur barrette informatis\u00e9e. Toutes ont fonctionn\u00e9 du premier coup &#8211; comme quoi le produit et sa doc sont de bonne qualit\u00e9.Il reste toutefois \u00e0 apprivoiser son utilisation, via le r\u00e9seau et les param\u00e8tres d&rsquo;enclenchement, d\u00e9clenchement&#8230;<\/p>\n<p>Un incident toutefois \u00e0 signaler: suite \u00e0 un court-circuit, Marcel a pu tester ce mode sur la prise \u00ab\u00a0master\u00a0\u00bb&#8230; Disjoncteur de l&rsquo;atelier en bas! Les d\u00e9g\u00e2ts: piste de cuivre vaporis\u00e9e sur 2 cm et r\u00e9sistance de shunt coup\u00e9e. Par pr\u00e9caution, le triac a aussi \u00e9t\u00e9 chang\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p>Trois samedi ont \u00e9t\u00e9 n\u00e9cessaires pour mener cette construction \u00e0 bout. Les ateliers ont permis de bons \u00e9changes dans une ambiance conviviale. L&rsquo;exp\u00e9rience est \u00e0 renouveler &#8211; probablement sur une projet moins ambitieux.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_507\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-507\" style=\"width: 512px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/08\/780-Suivre-le-mode-demploi.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-507 \" title=\"Suivre le mode d'emploi\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/08\/780-Suivre-le-mode-demploi.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"385\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/08\/780-Suivre-le-mode-demploi.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/08\/780-Suivre-le-mode-demploi-300x225.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-507\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Atelier montage barrette<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Les 7 inscrits ont termin\u00e9 le montage et r\u00e9glage de leur barrette informatis\u00e9e. Toutes ont fonctionn\u00e9 du premier coup &#8211;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":37,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[42,155,158,11,57,157,20,36],"class_list":["post-506","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-barrette","tag-embarque","tag-energy-saving","tag-hardware","tag-lan","tag-mxboard","tag-pic","tag-web"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/506","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/37"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=506"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/506\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1856,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/506\/revisions\/1856"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=506"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=506"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=506"}],"curies":[{"